格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"dsh 的安卓/Termux bash 能力提供者——显式 Termux 环境注入、探测诊断、诚实的应用域沙箱声明。","id":"gh:1333628490","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-shell-termux","slug":"kelai141/dsh-shell-termux","topics":["android","cordis-plugin","dsh-plugin","termux"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"dsh 的安卓/Termux bash 能力提供者——显式 Termux 环境注入、探测诊断、诚实的应用域沙箱声明。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-shell-termux"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"🌐 中文说明 / 中文 README"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> **DeepSeek Harness × Android 生态** · dsh-mobile-apk（壳 APK）· dsh-client-ui-responsive（移动 UI）· dsh-ho"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"st-web-compat（浏览器兼容）"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Android/Termux bash capability provider for DeepSeek Harness.\nRegisters as `ctx.shell` on Android so"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" the model's `bash` tool executes in a controlled Termux\nenvironment — no fake sandboxing, no depend"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ency on the ambient environment being accidentally right."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Why"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"On Android the upstream `bash-sandbox` fails closed (no bwrap/landlock/seatbelt platform chain),\nso "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"the bash tool is dead out of the box. This provider replaces it with an honest Termux execution\nworl"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"d: explicit environment injection, probe diagnostics, and a declared app-domain sandbox\nsemantics (`"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"workspace-write` + `enforcement: 'partial'`)."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**Prerequisite**: a Termux installation with `bash` (`pkg install bash`)."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"**1. Install** — put the package into the profile's node_modules (healed fallback resolves its\n`@dee"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"pseek-ai/*` dependencies to the running dsh instance):"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**2. Mount** — add to the profile's `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**3. Restart** the dsh service and verify with `--dump-config` (the row must be present, not disable"},{"id":"p14s2","text":". Restart** the dsh service and verify with `--dump-config` (the row must be present, not disabled)."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| key | meaning | default |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| `bashPath` | absolute bash binary path | required |\n| `prefix` | Termux prefix root (contains bin/"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" lib/) | required |\n| `home` | Termux home directory | required |\n| `termuxVersion` | TERMUX_VERSION"},{"id":"p17s3","text":" value injected | `0.118.3` |\n| `extraPath` | extra PATH entries prepended (e.g. /system/bin) | `[]`"},{"id":"p17s4","text":" |\n| `cwd` / `timeoutMs` / `maxTimeoutMs` / `maxOutputBytes` / `maxSpillBytes` / `graceMs` | inherit"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"ed local-executor knobs (editable via shell settings) | mirror `dsh-bash-local` |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- **Controlled environment** — every spawn injects `PATH`/`LD_LIBRARY_PATH`/`HOME`/`PREFIX`/`TERMUX_"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"VERSION`/`SHELL`\nexplicitly; execution never depends on the launcher environment.\n- **Reuses local m"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"echanics** — extends `LocalBashExecutor` (`runArgv`/`startArgv`): process-group\nSIGTERM→SIGKILL, out"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"put caps + spill, grace period, background lifecycle, teardown ownership.\n- **Honest sandbox declara"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"tion** — `sandboxMode = 'workspace-write'` (so permission presets mount)\nwith per-process `enforceme"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"nt: 'partial'`: the protection boundary is the Android app domain\n(SELinux u0_aXXX) plus the approva"},{"id":"p19s7","text":"l flow, not a path-level confiner.\n- **Probe diagnostics** — `probe()` reports bash presence/version"},{"id":"p19s8","text":" and missing toolchain packages\n(`pkg install bash coreutils findutils grep ripgrep` hints). Misconf"},{"id":"p19s9","text":"igured bash fails loud with\nrepair guidance.\n- **Single toolchain table** (0.2.0) — `REQUIRED_TOOLCH"},{"id":"p19s10","text":"AIN` / `PROBE_BINARIES` /\n`TOOLCHAIN_REPRESENTATIVE` are exported from one module, so the probe, ins"},{"id":"p19s11","text":"tall hints and any\nconsumer list cannot drift apart; a source-level test fails if a second copy of t"},{"id":"p19s12","text":"ny\nconsumer list cannot drift apart; a source-level test fails if a second copy of the table exists."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Verification"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- `probe()` status: `full` / `partial` / `unusable` with a missing-package list;\n- fault injection: "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"point `bashPath` at a missing binary → structured error\n(`shell-termux: <path> is not executable; ru"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"n 'pkg install bash' …`) returned to the model."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"MIT. Contains code derived from `@deepseek-ai/dsh-bash-local` (MIT, © 2026 DeepSeek) — see NOTICE.\nD"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"esign rationale: `docs/design.md`."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
